PROVENANCE NOTE, READ BEFORE RE-RUNNING: this PNG is a raster conversion of the
PDF, not an independent render. The S34 run could not write it because the Festus
compute node lacks X11 and Cairo. The conversion was performed with macOS `sips`
on a local machine because neither pdftoppm nor Ghostscript was available on the
cluster, and the result was then committed. The producing toolchain is therefore
NOT reproducible on the cluster, and the file left and re-entered the compute
environment.

This is recorded rather than corrected. The PNG carries no quantitative content
that the PDF does not, and nothing cites it. If the figure is regenerated, prefer
ragg::agg_png() or png(type = "cairo") from the producer directly and replace
both this sidecar and the file.

GATES: none. This artifact is a format conversion and asserts nothing.

